// Nothing derived is stored: what a pupil still owes, each instalment (paid / late / to come), the days late, absences, the average of a subject, the general average, the rank in the class, the
// mention, the months of salary still unpaid and the figures of the report come from the enrolment, its invoice, the attendance sheets, the evaluations and the salary operations.
